        {
          "answer": "Lesson 07\n\nYeh practice draft sirf tumhare diye product facts par hai. Fake claims ya customer testimonials nahi hain.\n\nDiye hue facts: कढ़ाई वाला चश्मे का कवर\n\nHonest product demo ka example (practice draft hai, saved template nahi):\n1. Normal home setting mein asli कढ़ाई वाला चश्मे का कवर ya uski reference image dikhao.\n2. कढ़ाई वाला चश्मे का कवर ka close view dikhao; shape, text aur logo same rakho.\n3. Presenter visible product ki taraf ishara kare; kharidne ya use karne ka personal experience claim mat karo.\nExample line: \"Yeh कढ़ाई वाला चश्मे का कवर hai. Order se pehle diye hue details dekho.\"\nAI presenter asli customer nahi hai. Naye benefits ya genuine customer testimonials mat banao.\n\nSirf tumhare diye features aur details use kiye hain; kuch naya invent nahi kiya hai.",
